<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">ubaitotte tsukandatte</font></b></font></font></font>

31
00:01:05,710 --> 00:01:11,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">even if I take it back, and grasp it</font></b></font></font></font>

32
00:01:11,380 --> 00:01:12,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">kimi janai nara</font></b></font></font></font>

33
00:01:11,380 --> 00:01:12,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">if you're not the one</font></b></font></font></font>

34
00:01:12,890 --> 00:01:13,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">imi wa nai no sa</font></b></font></font></font>

35
00:01:12,890 --> 00:01:13,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">there will be no meaning</font></b></font></font></font>

36
00:01:13,850 --> 00:01:20,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">dakara haruka kanata</font></b></font></font></font>

37
00:01:13,850 --> 00:01:20,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">and so we'll go far off into the distance</font></b></font></font></font>

38
00:01:38,280 --> 00:01:44,910
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Akamaru Surprised!</font>

39
00:01:38,280 --> 00:01:44,910
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Gaara's Exceptional Ability</font>

40
00:01:56,090 --> 00:01:57,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That guy...?</font>

41
00:01:57,680 --> 00:01:58,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone hide!</font>

42
00:01:58,800 --> 00:02:00,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, lie low quick!</font>

43
00:02:01,180 --> 00:02:03,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-Where is that guy?</font>

44
00:02:04,520 --> 00:02:05,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

45
00:02:06,310 --> 00:02:10,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That fool, he finally woke up.</font>

46
00:02:14,230 --> 00:02:16,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are quite one of a kind.</font>

47
00:02:17,240 --> 00:02:19,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Actually, you are getting on my nerves.</font>

48
00:02:27,750 --> 00:02:29,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chan!</font>

49
00:02:29,670 --> 00:02:31,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— What?
— Y-Y-Your...!</font>

50
00:02:32,250 --> 00:02:34,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chan... your hair!</font>

51
00:02:34,800 --> 00:02:37,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! This...?</font>

52
00:02:39,130 --> 00:02:42,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm changing my image,
changing my image!</font>

53
00:02:45,560 --> 00:02:48,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I like it better long but,</font>

54
00:02:48,430 --> 00:02:50,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">when I move around in
a forest like this,</font>

55
00:02:51,060 --> 00:02:52,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it gets in the way if it's long.</font>

56
00:02:55,780 --> 00:02:57,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By the way...</font>

57
00:02:57,240 --> 00:03:00,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">why are you guys here?!</font>

58
00:03:00,910 --> 00:03:05,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hah... It's such a pain
to explain it to you.</font>

59
00:03:05,910 --> 00:03:08,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everybody helped out.</font>

60
00:03:08,370 --> 00:03:09,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

61
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:13,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura's putting on a show of bravado...</font>

62
00:03:16,170 --> 00:03:17,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll take care of him from here.</font>

63
00:03:18,460 --> 00:03:20,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ah... Okay...</font>

64
00:03:20,930 --> 00:03:23,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Keep it together! Lee!</font>

65
00:03:27,350 --> 00:03:31,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh? Tenten, why are you here?</font>

66
00:03:31,230 --> 00:03:32,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I came to help.</font>

67
00:03:33,440 --> 00:03:34,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh...?</font>

68
00:03:34,860 --> 00:03:36,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those guys,
where's the Sound Village Ninja?</font>

69
00:03:37,190 --> 00:03:39,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A kid named Sasuke
drove them away!</font>

70
00:03:40,900 --> 00:03:41,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really...</font>

71
00:03:42,990 --> 00:03:45,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why did you hastily decide
to act on your own?!</font>

72
00:03:46,240 --> 00:03:47,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Besides, you really got beaten up!</font>

73
00:03:49,160 --> 00:03:53,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">S-Sakura-san was in danger.
So as a man, I...</font>

74
00:03:54,580 --> 00:03:55,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're kidding...!</font>

75
00:03:55,880 --> 00:03:59,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If it were Lee alone,
he wouldn't have lost to those guys.</font>

76
00:03:59,960 --> 00:04:02,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're really stupid.</font>

77
00:04:04,140 --> 00:04:06,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't argue with that.</font>

78
00:04:06,720 --> 00:04:09,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You, Bushy-Brow!</font>

79
00:04:10,220 --> 00:04:11,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

80
00:04:11,480 --> 00:04:15,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't say rude things to Lee-san!</font>

81
00:04:17,610 --> 00:04:18,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What in the world...</font>

82
00:04:18,820 --> 00:04:21,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">happened while I was asleep?</font>

83
00:04:23,280 --> 00:04:26,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Naruto,
he's completely out of the loop.</font>

84
00:04:27,030 --> 00:04:31,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's not the type to be
the protagonist of a story, certainly not.</font>

85
00:04:34,960 --> 00:04:35,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee-san...</font>

86
00:04:37,210 --> 00:04:38,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you.</font>

87
00:04:39,750 --> 00:04:42,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because of you,
I was able to wake up.</font>

88
00:04:43,720 --> 00:04:46,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I feel like I've gotten a little stronger!</font>

89
00:04:50,680 --> 00:04:51,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-san...</font>

90
00:04:52,980 --> 00:04:57,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It looks like my efforts
weren't enough!</font>

91
00:04:58,360 --> 00:05:02,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun... Just what you'd expect
from the Uchiha clan.</font>

92
00:05:03,320 --> 00:05:05,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To chase off the Sound Village Ninja,</font>

93
00:05:05,240 --> 00:05:08,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">just as I thought,
you possess amazing strength.</font>

94
00:05:09,030 --> 00:05:11,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was beaten to a pulp.</font>

95
00:05:11,330 --> 00:05:14,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! He was beaten to a pulp?!</font>

96
00:05:15,830 --> 00:05:17,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's he talking about?</font>

97
00:05:17,580 --> 00:05:20,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Were those guys really that strong?</font>

98
00:05:21,460 --> 00:05:22,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-san!</font>

99
00:05:23,210 --> 00:05:25,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Lotus of Leaf Village
blooms twice.</font>

100
00:05:25,680 --> 00:05:26,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

101
00:05:27,130 --> 00:05:30,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When we meet again,
I will have become a stronger man.</font>

102
00:05:32,100 --> 00:05:33,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I pledge it.</font>

103
00:05:35,810 --> 00:05:36,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay.</font>

104
00:05:39,360 --> 00:05:40,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Sakura!</font>

105
00:05:41,110 --> 00:05:42,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come here, come here!</font>

106
00:05:42,730 --> 00:05:44,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your hair! I'll fix it for you!</font>

107
00:05:46,900 --> 00:05:48,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That'd be great.</font>

108
00:05:54,250 --> 00:05:56,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are really sneaky.</font>

109
00:05:56,500 --> 00:05:59,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hugging him like that,
you little billboard brow.</font>

110
00:05:59,460 --> 00:06:03,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's called first come-first served,
Miss Ino Pig.</font>

111
00:06:10,140 --> 00:06:12,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uchiha... Sasuke.</font>

112
00:06:17,640 --> 00:06:20,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At any rate... he's a strong opponent.</font>

113
00:06:23,730 --> 00:06:25,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you okay, Akamaru?</font>

114
00:06:28,200 --> 00:06:29,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is he still shaking?</font>

115
00:06:30,410 --> 00:06:32,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's already been half a day.</font>

116
00:06:33,490 --> 00:06:34,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru...</font>

117
00:06:35,290 --> 00:06:39,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't blame him,
it's because he saw that thing...</font>

118
00:06:43,170 --> 00:06:45,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After all, brains are most important
in survival!</font>

119
00:06:45,420 --> 00:06:47,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right. Akamaru?</font>

120
00:06:48,840 --> 00:06:50,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lucky for us,</font>

121
00:06:50,680 --> 00:06:53,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the guys who got caught in
the trap had an earth scroll!</font>

122
00:06:53,350 --> 00:06:56,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll be the first to
the tower at this rate!</font>

123
00:06:56,890 --> 00:07:00,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't get carried away.
That's dangerous.</font>

124
00:07:01,270 --> 00:07:05,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No matter how small a bug it is,
it has to guard itself at all times.</font>

125
00:07:05,730 --> 00:07:08,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We have to pay attention to avoid
coming across any enemies...</font>

126
00:07:09,200 --> 00:07:10,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is safety.</font>

127
00:07:10,450 --> 00:07:12,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know that!</font>

128
00:07:12,320 --> 00:07:16,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As always, you're speaking in a way
that's difficult to understand, bug-nerd.</font>

129
00:07:17,750 --> 00:07:21,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Um... B-But...
What Shino-kun said...</font>

130
00:07:21,540 --> 00:07:23,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He has a point.</font>

131
00:07:23,460 --> 00:07:25,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know! C'mon.</font>

132
00:07:26,750 --> 00:07:27,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun...</font>

133
00:07:28,340 --> 00:07:29,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I hope nothing's happened to him...</font>

134
00:07:32,550 --> 00:07:34,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey you two, stop.</font>

135
00:07:36,430 --> 00:07:39,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're being careful not to
come across enemy, right?</font>

136
00:07:40,140 --> 00:07:41,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then Hinata!</font>

137
00:07:42,140 --> 00:07:44,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Can you see 1 kilometer
in that direction?</font>

138
00:07:46,360 --> 00:07:48,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yep... I'll have a look.
Byakugan!</font>

139
00:07:55,780 --> 00:07:57,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-There's someone there.</font>

140
00:08:00,910 --> 00:08:04,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Evidently there are... 6 people...</font>

141
00:08:04,710 --> 00:08:06,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay! Let's go look!</font>

142
00:08:07,210 --> 00:08:08,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

143
00:08:08,380 --> 00:08:12,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kiba! What are you saying?
We're not doing that.</font>

144
00:08:12,340 --> 00:08:14,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Proctor told us to bring</font>

145
00:08:14,340 --> 00:08:16,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">one of each "Heaven" and "Earth"
scroll in a pair.</font>

146
00:08:17,470 --> 00:08:20,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He didn't say not to
take more than that.</font>

147
00:08:20,680 --> 00:08:26,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we take more, that means
some other teams will be left out.</font>

148
00:08:27,520 --> 00:08:28,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">B-But...</font>

149
00:08:29,230 --> 00:08:31,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll just see what's going on at first..</font>

150
00:08:31,360 --> 00:08:34,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If it looks too dangerous,
we won't battle for no reason.</font>

151
00:08:34,240 --> 00:08:35,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Let's go!
— Oh!</font>

152
00:08:36,570 --> 00:08:39,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's an irritating type, that one.</font>

153
00:08:47,170 --> 00:08:49,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's up, Akamaru?</font>

154
00:08:50,090 --> 00:08:52,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What happened? You stopped suddenly.</font>

155
00:08:55,340 --> 00:08:57,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru suddenly got frightened.</font>

156
00:08:57,930 --> 00:08:59,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-Why is that?</font>

157
00:09:00,100 --> 00:09:04,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru can sniff out the level of enemy's
Chakra and tell his strength.</font>

158
00:09:05,100 --> 00:09:07,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But this is the first time I've
seen him this scared.</font>

159
00:09:08,770 --> 00:09:12,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The people going at it up ahead
aren't ordinary guys...</font>

160
00:09:17,410 --> 00:09:21,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sand Village kids coming
to challenge us forthright.</font>

161
00:09:22,410 --> 00:09:23,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's foolish.</font>

162
00:09:34,510 --> 00:09:39,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's that little guy thinking
to get involved with those guys...?!</font>

163
00:09:43,520 --> 00:09:45,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What is Akamaru saying...?</font>

164
00:09:45,270 --> 00:09:48,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's saying that big guy is dangerous.</font>

165
00:09:51,360 --> 00:09:53,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-They certainly look like bad news...</font>

166
00:09:54,360 --> 00:09:55,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They seem really strong.</font>

167
00:09:56,240 --> 00:09:59,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, kids, you should
pick your opponents...</font>

168
00:10:00,620 --> 00:10:02,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're all going to die.</font>

169
00:10:02,580 --> 00:10:04,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's enough of you.</font>

170
00:10:04,700 --> 00:10:08,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's do this quickly...
old man from Hidden Rain Village.</font>

171
00:10:09,750 --> 00:10:13,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Which scroll do those guys have...</font>

172
00:10:14,210 --> 00:10:15,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Gaara!</font>

173
00:10:15,840 --> 00:10:17,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Doesn't it make sense to
follow them</font>

174
00:10:17,510 --> 00:10:19,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and gather information
before hunting them?</font>

175
00:10:20,180 --> 00:10:23,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If they have the same type of scroll
there's no need to fight.</font>

176
00:10:24,100 --> 00:10:25,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Unnecessary battles are-</font>

177
00:10:25,140 --> 00:10:26,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It doesn't matter.</font>

178
00:10:27,850 --> 00:10:31,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If their eyes meet with mine...
I'll kill them all.</font>

179
00:10:33,860 --> 00:10:37,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why I don't want
to be with this guy.</font>

180
00:10:39,240 --> 00:10:42,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, let's do it. Quickly!</font>

181
00:10:48,080 --> 00:10:49,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Die, kid!</font>

182
00:10:49,460 --> 00:10:51,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art: Senbon Rainstorm!</font>

183
00:10:54,750 --> 00:10:55,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hidden Senbons!</font>

184
00:11:02,510 --> 00:11:05,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Up, down, right, left,
there is no dead spot in this Jutsu.</font>

185
00:11:05,760 --> 00:11:08,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In addition, all the Senbons are
controlled by my Chakra</font>

186
00:11:08,930 --> 00:11:11,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and attack on the intended prey!</font>

187
00:11:15,770 --> 00:11:16,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Too easy.</font>

188
00:11:25,240 --> 00:11:26,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that all?</font>

189
00:11:27,040 --> 00:11:28,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-It can't be...?!</font>

190
00:11:28,370 --> 00:11:29,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not even one...?</font>

191
00:11:29,540 --> 00:11:32,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No wounds...? Ridiculous!</font>

192
00:11:37,130 --> 00:11:38,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Senbon Rainstorm, huh...?</font>

193
00:11:40,010 --> 00:11:43,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, I'll make it rain blood.</font>

194
00:11:53,100 --> 00:11:55,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a giant Chakra.</font>

195
00:11:55,810 --> 00:11:58,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And, that sand...</font>

196
00:11:59,110 --> 00:12:00,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It smells terrible.</font>

197
00:12:02,030 --> 00:12:03,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Smell?</font>

198
00:12:06,030 --> 00:12:08,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A strong smell of blood...</font>

199
00:12:10,120 --> 00:12:11,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wall of sand...?</font>

200
00:12:12,250 --> 00:12:16,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right.
An absolute defense by sand!</font>

201
00:12:16,960 --> 00:12:19,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He manipulates sand inside
a gourd and</font>

202
00:12:19,090 --> 00:12:20,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">hardens it with magnified Chakra.</font>

203
00:12:21,380 --> 00:12:23,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It defends the circumference
of Gaara's body.</font>

204
00:12:23,470 --> 00:12:25,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a Jutsu that only
he can get away with...</font>

205
00:12:26,510 --> 00:12:28,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Furthermore, it's somehow always
automatically done</font>

206
00:12:28,970 --> 00:12:31,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">without Gaara's intentions.</font>

207
00:12:32,020 --> 00:12:36,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Which means that all attacks
in front of Gaara fade into nothing.</font>

208
00:12:37,820 --> 00:12:38,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That little...</font>

209
00:12:39,110 --> 00:12:42,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys can't defeat our Gaara.</font>

210
00:12:43,320 --> 00:12:45,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't underestimate me!</font>

211
00:12:51,120 --> 00:12:52,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This guy's a goner...</font>

212
00:12:53,290 --> 00:12:55,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's what you get for rebelling
against Gaara...</font>

213
00:12:56,710 --> 00:12:58,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sand Coffin!</font>

214
00:13:08,850 --> 00:13:10,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't move...</font>

215
00:13:16,310 --> 00:13:18,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-This won't...!</font>

216
00:13:22,820 --> 00:13:26,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can cover your loud mouth
and kill you.</font>

217
00:13:33,410 --> 00:13:35,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But that's too pathetic.</font>

218
00:14:01,150 --> 00:14:02,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sand Burial!</font>

219
00:14:15,370 --> 00:14:17,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no pain.</font>

220
00:14:17,580 --> 00:14:21,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I knocked him even harder
than was necessary.</font>

221
00:14:21,710 --> 00:14:25,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The bloody tears of a corpse merge
with vast sinking sand</font>

222
00:14:26,220 --> 00:14:29,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and provide more power
to the demon of war.</font>

223
00:14:31,390 --> 00:14:32,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-The scroll.</font>

224
00:14:33,180 --> 00:14:34,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll give it to you!</font>

225
00:14:36,180 --> 00:14:38,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please! Let us go!</font>

226
00:14:45,190 --> 00:14:46,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No!</font>

227
00:14:55,580 --> 00:14:56,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-This is bad.</font>

228
00:14:57,040 --> 00:15:00,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's escape quickly!
If he finds us he'll kill us!</font>

229
00:15:04,630 --> 00:15:06,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Luckily it is a Heaven scroll.</font>

230
00:15:07,210 --> 00:15:09,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay! Let's go to the tower.</font>

231
00:15:09,880 --> 00:15:10,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up.</font>

232
00:15:12,050 --> 00:15:14,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's still... not enough for me!</font>

233
00:15:16,970 --> 00:15:19,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">U-Uh-oh! Did he notice us?!</font>

234
00:15:21,150 --> 00:15:23,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's quit... Gaara.</font>

235
00:15:25,440 --> 00:15:27,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you scared, coward?</font>

236
00:15:29,240 --> 00:15:35,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gaara! It's certainly no problem for you,
but it's too dangerous for us!</font>

237
00:15:35,780 --> 00:15:37,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One set of scrolls is good.</font>

238
00:15:38,330 --> 00:15:39,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">More than this is...</font>

239
00:15:42,000 --> 00:15:44,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lame people don't give directions to me.</font>

240
00:15:48,010 --> 00:15:49,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's enough!</font>

241
00:15:49,840 --> 00:15:52,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How about if you sometimes listen
to what your older brother has to say?!</font>

242
00:15:53,510 --> 00:15:56,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've never thought of you as my siblings.</font>

243
00:15:57,260 --> 00:16:00,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you get in my way... I'll kill you.</font>

244
00:16:07,020 --> 00:16:09,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">G-Gaara cut it out! Please.</font>

245
00:16:10,110 --> 00:16:12,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't say something so cold.</font>

246
00:16:12,860 --> 00:16:16,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As a favor to your sister... Okay?!</font>

247
00:16:39,890 --> 00:16:40,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gaara!</font>

248
00:16:50,230 --> 00:16:51,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fine.</font>

249
00:17:08,000 --> 00:17:10,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why I hate brats.</font>

250
00:17:17,590 --> 00:17:20,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? So that's it Akamaru?</font>

251
00:17:20,890 --> 00:17:23,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">C'mon, you should have
said something sooner.</font>

252
00:17:29,440 --> 00:17:30,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nobody's here...?</font>

253
00:17:31,480 --> 00:17:34,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heh heh! We're the first?!</font>

254
00:17:34,700 --> 00:17:37,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, I sensed someone a little while ago.</font>

255
00:17:38,410 --> 00:17:40,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">More importantly, is Akamaru okay?</font>

256
00:17:41,030 --> 00:17:43,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's been scared ever since then.</font>

257
00:17:44,620 --> 00:17:47,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now that you mention it,
what did Akamaru say before?</font>

258
00:17:47,920 --> 00:17:51,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh... Akamaru said that it
was dangerous</font>

259
00:17:51,250 --> 00:17:54,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">because that sand squirt
would kill that big guy.</font>

260
00:17:54,840 --> 00:17:57,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sheesh! Just like I thought,
there's no other place to go!</font>

261
00:17:58,680 --> 00:18:00,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They've already made us
wait for half a day!</font>

262
00:18:01,260 --> 00:18:02,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How much longer do we have to wait?</font>

263
00:18:21,240 --> 00:18:24,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anyway. That Sand Village squirt...</font>

264
00:18:24,700 --> 00:18:27,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know what he is but,
that guy...</font>

265
00:18:28,000 --> 00:18:29,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's too dangerous.</font>

266
00:18:37,420 --> 00:18:42,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's becoming a real disaster,
but we can't cancel this test.</font>

267
00:18:42,720 --> 00:18:44,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean?</font>

268
00:18:44,560 --> 00:18:45,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Excuse me!</font>

269
00:18:46,060 --> 00:18:49,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it?!
We're talking about something important!</font>

270
00:18:49,940 --> 00:18:50,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Excuse me.</font>

271
00:18:50,810 --> 00:18:51,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... Uh...</font>

272
00:18:51,940 --> 00:18:53,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please take a look at this!</font>

273
00:18:53,610 --> 00:18:54,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The video...?</font>

274
00:18:58,990 --> 00:19:02,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ready? Here! Look at the time!</font>

275
00:19:11,080 --> 00:19:12,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-This is...</font>

276
00:19:12,580 --> 00:19:14,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a recording inside the tower,</font>

277
00:19:14,250 --> 00:19:18,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">one hour and thirty-seven minutes
after the start of the second test!</font>

278
00:19:20,470 --> 00:19:24,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Three Shinobi from Hidden Sand Village
broke through the second test.</font>

279
00:19:28,180 --> 00:19:29,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This can't be...!</font>

280
00:19:29,890 --> 00:19:31,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In a mere ninety-seven minutes...</font>

281
00:19:33,310 --> 00:19:35,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This has never happened!</font>

282
00:19:36,480 --> 00:19:37,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is an anomaly.</font>

283
00:19:38,440 --> 00:19:40,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those guys are not Genin level.</font>

284
00:19:41,110 --> 00:19:45,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They've rewritten the
fastest time by four hours...</font>

285
00:19:46,790 --> 00:19:48,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not just that.</font>

286
00:19:49,160 --> 00:19:50,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean?</font>

287
00:19:51,460 --> 00:19:54,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's 10 kilometers
from the test entrances to the tower.</font>

288
00:19:55,250 --> 00:19:58,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ferocious animals, poisonous insects,
the rugged forest road...</font>

289
00:19:59,210 --> 00:20:02,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As if those were not there...</font>

290
00:20:03,590 --> 00:20:05,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Especially the brown-haired kid
right in front...</font>

291
00:20:06,850 --> 00:20:08,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What about him?</font>

292
00:20:08,520 --> 00:20:09,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't notice?</font>

293
00:20:15,610 --> 00:20:18,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see. This is quite a surprise.</font>

294
00:20:19,440 --> 00:20:22,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What about him is so...?</font>

295
00:20:23,110 --> 00:20:25,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look closely at his body.</font>

296
00:20:35,380 --> 00:20:36,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see.</font>

297
00:20:36,880 --> 00:20:38,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He doesn't have a single scratch.</font>

298
00:20:38,920 --> 00:20:43,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's worse, there's not
a smudge of dirt on his clothing.</font>

299
00:20:43,840 --> 00:20:45,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even I...</font>

300
00:20:45,510 --> 00:20:48,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, any of the other Chunin...</font>

301
00:20:48,810 --> 00:20:52,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's impossible for us to
make it to this tower without a scratch.</font>

302
00:20:52,680 --> 00:20:55,850
